Guards
======

*Holding the door.*

.. raw:: ms

   .br
   .mso hdtbl.tmac
   .ne 14
   .TBL cols=4 border=.5p bc=black csp=2p cpd=2p width='25% 25% 25% 25%'
   .CPTN val=b "Attacks & Combat Stats (EXTRA)"
   .TR
   .TH Name
   .TH Roll
   .TH DX
   .TH End
   .TR
   .TD
   \fBRifle\fP
   .TD hal=c 3
   .TD hal=c
   3
   .TD hal=c 0
   .TR
   .TH Defense
   .TH Health
   .TH Endurance
   .TH TV
   .TR
   .TD hal=c
   \fB2\fP
   .TD hal=c \fB10\fP
   .TD hal=c \fB10\fP
   .TD hal=c \fB1\fP
   .ETB

